 "remarks": "Welcome to the highly sought-after Chesterfield Complex! This beautifully renovated two-level townhouse, updated in 2021, offers the perfect blend of modern style and comfortable living. Featuring 2 spacious bedrooms, a dedicated home office, and 1.5 elegantly appointed bathrooms, this home boasts an open-concept main floor designed for today's lifestyle.  Gleaming hardwood floors flow throughout the entire unit, while the inviting living room showcases a cozy woodburning fireplace and opens to a private enclosed patio, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The updated eat-in kitchen features a stunning quartz center island, providing ample space for cooking, dining, and gathering.  Upstairs, you'll find generously sized bedrooms and beautifully finished marble bathrooms, adding a touch of luxury to everyday living.  Residents of Chesterfield enjoy an array of exceptional amenities, including a swimming pool, clubhouse, and security, all within a well-maintained community.  Don't miss this opportunity to own a move-in-ready home in one of the area's most desirable complexes!",
